              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $0</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ $500 one-time platform setup fee</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Ongoing Cost</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ None, one-time, you own it</td>
