            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Contract Commitment</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ No contract, no commitment</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Lead packages require 12-month or 6-month terms</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Lead Source</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Verified, enriched prospect list (your niche + area)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Paid ad leads: Social $299/mo, Search $599/mo, Seller $599/mo</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
