              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">What You Own</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ The list, the data, everything, forever</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Nothing, you rent the platform</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Follow-Up</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ AI agent + receptionist catch and qualify replies 24/7</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">⚠️ Geek AI Text $49/mo (texting only, free with a lead package)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">WhatsApp Integration</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included (full AI conversations)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">❌ Not available</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
